# --- e2e/output split (intentional) ---
# Tracked: judgments (docs/decisions/) AND deliberate scoreboard baselines.
# calm-budget-run.md is the TRACKED scoreboard — updated only via
#   npm run calm -- --record   (or npm run calm:record)
# Default calm writes calm-budget-last.md/.json (untracked). A tool must not
# write a tracked path as a side effect of running — that dirties the tree,
# blocks checkout, and can leave a checker measuring a stale detached head
# (crab scar: detach failed, nearly reported 114/115 against the wrong commit).
# Ignored: raw evidence dumps — shots, probe JSON/logs, skill dumps, last-run.
# Cite shot paths from reviews; do not commit shot folders.
e2e/output/
!e2e/output/calm-budget-run.md

# AI assistant harness (LOCAL ONLY — never commit / never push)
# Reason: branch checkouts must not swap the agent's brain or skills.
# Product docs about the in-app agent panel stay tracked (docs/04-agents.md, etc.).
# Full rule: docs/AGENTS_ROLES.md § "AI harness stays local"
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.agents/
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.cursorrules
.aider*
.codex/
.jcode/
